<title>USA: TABLE-Amrion Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Amrion Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			     June 30,		     June 30,</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	   1997	  1996</p>
<p>Net sales	$16,875,906 $11,871,331 $35,232,650 $25,253,287</p>
